request.description:
List every department in the hospital, each with its `doctor_count` and the doctors nested inside. Use this so the voice AI can read out available departments when the caller doesn't name a doctor.

**Response**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "count": 9,
    "departments": [
      { "department": "Cardiology", "doctor_count": 1, "doctors": [ { "doctor_id": "uuid", "name": "Dr. Amit Patel", "specialty": "Cardiology" } ] }
    ]
  }
}
```

List the doctors in a department. Each doctor includes their next available slot — ideal for offering a caller a doctor + time in one step. Omit the `department` query param to return all doctors.

**Response**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "count": 1,
    "doctors": [
      {
        "doctor_id": "a0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
        "name": "Dr. Amit Patel",
        "department": "Cardiology",
        "specialty": "Cardiology",
        "available": true,
        "next_available": { "date": "2026-07-22", "day": "Wednesday", "time": "09:00" }
      }
    ]
  }
}
```
